# Enterprise Data Processing System

## 📌 Overview
This project is a Python-based backend system designed to simulate an enterprise-level data processing pipeline. It focuses on handling large datasets efficiently by applying data validation, transformation, and batch processing techniques.

## 🚀 Features
- Data extraction from CSV files
- Data validation and error handling
- Data transformation and cleaning
- Batch processing simulation
- Modular architecture using OOP principles
- Scalable and maintainable code structure

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)

## 📂 Project Structure
- data/ → Input datasets
- src/ → Core application logic
- tests/ → Unit tests

## ▶️ How to Run
1. Clone the repository:
   git clone https://github.com/yourusername/enterprise-data-processing.git

2. Navigate to project folder:
   cd enterprise-data-processing

3. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

4. Run the application:
   python src/main.py

## 📊 Sample Use Case
Processes raw CSV data, validates records, removes inconsistencies, and outputs cleaned data ready for analytics or storage.

